This product implements mechanisms described in C. S. Wright, "On Immutable
Memory Systems for Artificial Agents" (arXiv:2506.13246). This licence grants
no rights in third-party patents.

Proof sharding (selective proof of existence / MPE, DIS-002): this product
implements a mechanism claimed by nChain's US 12,730,827 B2 patent (granted
2026-09-08) under the Open BSV pledge — nChain/BSVA's grant of free use of
its patent portfolio on BSV (including its testnets), revocable for
non-BSV use. nektar is BSV-only by construction.

Third-party Go and UI dependencies are declared in go.mod and ui/package.json
with their own licences. Test vectors in vectors/smt-rust.json and
vectors/curve-rust.json were generated by running third-party Rust crates
(identity-attribution idattr-smt, triple-entry-evidence-bsv bsvcurve) as oracles.
